---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact · Hugo Perez" description="Contact Hugo Perez for engineering and product opportunities.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Open channel / contact</span><h1>Let’s make the<br/>problem concrete.</h1><p>Share the context, the constraints and what success needs to look like. I’ll respond with the next useful question.</p></header>
    <div class="channels terminal-panel"><a href="mailto:hugoperezaraus@gmail.com"><span>01 / EMAIL</span><strong>hugoperezaraus@gmail.com</strong><i>↗</i></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hugoperezaraus/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>02 / LINKEDIN</span><strong>linkedin.com/in/hugoperezaraus</strong><i>↗</i></a><a href="https://github.com/hugopza" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>03 / GITHUB</span><strong>github.com/hugopza</strong><i>↗</i></a><button type="button" data-bot-open><span>04 / ASSISTANT</span><strong>Start a local bot session</strong><i>→</i></button></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.channels{overflow:hidden}.channels a,.channels button{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:10rem 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:1.5rem;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bg-border);color:inherit;background:transparent;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s}.channels>:last-child{border-bottom:0}.channels a:hover,.channels button:hover{color:var(--accent-primary);background:var(--accent-soft)}.channels span{color:var(--text-muted);font:.65rem var(--font-mono)}.channels strong{font:500 clamp(.9rem,2vw,1.25rem) var(--font-display)}.channels i{font-style:normal}@media(max-width:650px){.channels a,.channels button{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}.channels span{grid-column:1/-1}}
</style>
